<title>AUSTRIA: Wiener St'ische expands into Italy.</title>
<headline>Wiener St'ische expands into Italy.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian blue-chip insurer Wiener Staedtische Allgemeine Versicherung AG said on Wednesday it planned to launch insurance services in the German speaking parts of neighbouring northern Italy.</p>
<p>In a statement the firm said services offered in southern Tyrol and Trentino would include life, health, accident and home insurance. It said Austrian law would apply to policies, which would be written in German.</p>
<p>Wiener Staedtische said sales would be managed by independent agents and agencies and said it did not plan to build up its own sales network initially for financial reasons.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
